{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/182fd1c87d850bcef050b9fcdef165e9.poster.avif?t=1753900443\" aria-label=\"Be the detective, find clues, and piece together the case.\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/182fd1c87d850bcef050b9fcdef165e9.webm?t=1753900443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/182fd1c87d850bcef050b9fcdef165e9.mp4?t=1753900443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEE THE FUTURE\u00a0\u2014\u00a0FIND THE CLUES\u00a0\u2014\u00a0SOLVE THE MURDER</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Seer. Through your visions, you see the past and future. But do you have the wits to untangle the truth?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into an underworld of red\u2011glowing seas, pitch\u2011black caverns, and grand elven cities. Follow a trail of ancient artifacts, dark rituals, and the plots of cunning elves to find the truth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/b316fcf37172080e053c6934600091d4.poster.avif?t=1753900443\" aria-label=\"Interactive scenes where you look for clues to solve the murder.\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/b316fcf37172080e053c6934600091d4.webm?t=1753900443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/b316fcf37172080e053c6934600091d4.mp4?t=1753900443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each case sends you into a prophetic vision, a murder frozen in time.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-and-click your way through the scene, as you examine characters, pockets, objects, and scenery. Read documents, letters, and journals. Every detail is vital to the case.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you have gathered all the pieces of the puzzle, switch to the thinking screen. Use clues and keywords to name the killer, method, motive, and location.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get it right and the mystery unravels, each solved case pulling you closer to the secret behind your visions.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/aaa3d4f4006f27161da8c8b77ba2a692.poster.avif?t=1753900443\" aria-label=\"A duel among pirates. But who killed who and why?\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/aaa3d4f4006f27161da8c8b77ba2a692.webm?t=1753900443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/aaa3d4f4006f27161da8c8b77ba2a692.mp4?t=1753900443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prophetic Detective Puzzles:</strong> Solve murders through your visions.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Murder Investigation:</strong> Inspect suspects, examine evidence, and read documents.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logical Deduction:</strong> Piece together the case from the clues to figure out what happened.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Underworld:</strong> Explore the subterranean world of scheming elves, ancient secrets, and forbidden magic.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837870?t=1753900443","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/1f4a584e04f65402fa91d1d7b33caa7ee88fd571/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753900443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/c24d91959b85942686b085878b0cb875aca666a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753900443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/c24d91959b85942686b085878b0cb875aca666a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753900443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game depicts freeze-frame dioramas of murder scenes illustrated in a 2D art style. It includes some mature themes, violence, blood, intoxication, mild profanity, and mild nudity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/182fd1c87d850bcef050b9fcdef165e9.poster.avif?t=1753900443\" aria-label=\"Be the detective, find clues, and piece together the case.\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/182fd1c87d850bcef050b9fcdef165e9.webm?t=1753900443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837870/extras/182fd1c87d850bcef050b9fcdef165e9.mp4?t=1753900443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEE THE FUTURE\u00a0\u2014\u00a0FIND THE CLUES\u00a0\u2014\u00a0